WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:09.960
One of America's most popular emissaries gets a warm reception as he arrives in the troubled

00:09.960 --> 00:13.840
Congo on a State Department-sponsored goodwill mission.

00:13.840 --> 00:18.720
Louis Satchmo Armstrong, whose golden trumpet has preached the gospel of New Orleans jazz

00:18.720 --> 00:31.400
on every continent, arrives in truly royal style.

00:31.400 --> 00:36.520
Louis' solid swinging outraged Radio Moscow, which blasted Armstrong's visit as a diversionary

00:36.520 --> 00:50.800
tactic, a left-handed tribute to a mellow cat the Congolese find right on the bean.

